---
// Project Case Study Modal Dialog (Full SI Case Study: Role, Process, Impact, Artifacts, & Interactive Demo)
---
<div class="overlay" id="project-overlay" role="presentation">
  <div class="dialog" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="detail-name" tabindex="-1">
    <div id="detail-brand-bar" class="dialog-brand-bar" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <button class="dialog-close" type="button" data-close aria-label="Tutup dialog">×</button>
    <span class="eyebrow mono" id="detail-category">STUDI KASUS</span>
    <h2 id="detail-name" class="display">PROJECT</h2>
    <div id="detail-type" class="dialog-type-badge mono"></div>

    <div class="dialog-preview-wrap">
      <div class="dialog-preview-head mono">
        <span>PRATINJAU INTERAKTIF HALAMAN UTAMA APLIKASI</span>
        <span id="detail-preview-badge">LIVE UI REPLICA</span>
      </div>
      <div id="detail-preview" class="dialog-preview"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="dialog-role-box">
      <div class="dialog-role-col">
        <span class="dialog-role-label mono">PERAN &amp; TANGGUNG JAWAB</span>
        <p id="detail-role" class="dialog-role-text"></p>
      </div>
      <div class="dialog-role-col">
        <span class="dialog-role-label mono">DOKUMENTASI &amp; ARTEFAK PROYEK</span>
        <div id="detail-artifacts" class="dialog-artifacts-list"></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="dialog-grid">
      <div>
        <h3 class="mono">Masalah Bisnis (Kondisi As-Is)</h3>
        <p id="detail-problem"></p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="mono">Solusi &amp; Arsitektur (Kondisi To-Be)</h3>
        <p id="detail-approach"></p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h3 class="mono">Proses Pengerjaan (Analisis Kebutuhan → Desain → Implementasi)</h3>
    <div class="dialog-process-grid">
      <div class="dialog-process-step">
        <span class="process-step-num mono">01 · ANALISIS KEBUTUHAN</span>
        <p id="detail-process-analysis"></p>
      </div>
      <div class="dialog-process-step">
        <span class="process-step-num mono">02 · DESAIN SISTEM &amp; UI/UX</span>
        <p id="detail-process-design"></p>
      </div>
      <div class="dialog-process-step">
        <span class="process-step-num mono">03 · IMPLEMENTASI &amp; PENGUJIAN</span>
        <p id="detail-process-impl"></p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h3 class="mono">Hasil &amp; Dampak Terukur</h3>
    <ul class="dialog-highlights dialog-impact-list" id="detail-impact-list"></ul>

    <h3 class="mono">Fitur &amp; Kapabilitas Utama Aplikasi</h3>
    <ul class="dialog-highlights" id="detail-highlights"></ul>

    <h3 class="mono">Tools &amp; Teknologi yang Dipakai</h3>
    <div class="dialog-stack" id="detail-stack"></div>

    <div class="dialog-actions" style="margin-top: 22px; display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap;">
      <a id="detail-repo" class="button dark tiny" href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        Kunjungi GitHub Repository <span class="arrow">↗</span>
      </a>
      <a id="detail-demo-url" class="button yellow tiny" href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="display: none;">
        Buka Live Demo <span class="arrow">↗</span>
      </a>
      <a id="detail-figma-url" class="button tiny" href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="display: none;">
        Prototipe Figma <span class="arrow">↗</span>
      </a>
      <button id="detail-demo-jump" class="button tiny" type="button">
        Coba Pratinjau Interaktif <span class="arrow">↑</span>
      </button>
    </div>

    <div class="dialog-note">
      Studi kasus disusun berdasarkan rekam jejak nyata commit, Pull Request, artefak perancangan (Project Charter, PRD, Procurement Plan, Skema DB), dan implementasi kode sumber pada repositori GitHub resmi.
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
